  "content": "\n\n<h1>視角名稱標籤</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/KKW557/perspectivenametag?tab=MIT-1-ov-file#readme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/KKW557/perspectivenametag\" alt=\"GitHub License\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/KKW557/perspectivenametag/actions/workflows/build.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/KKW557/perspectivenametag/build.yml\" alt=\"GitHub Actions Workflow Status\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/KKW557/perspectivenametag/releases/latest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/KKW557/perspectivenametag\" alt=\"GitHub Release\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fperspectivenametag\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/perspectivenametag?logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth Downloads\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/perspectivenametag\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1499392?logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge Downloads\"></a></p>\n<p>一款讓玩家在第二／第三人稱視角下也能看到自身名稱標籤的模組。</p>\n<h2>常見問題</h2>\n<h3>Forge／NeoForge？</h3>\n<p>針對 <strong>Forge</strong>／<strong>NeoForge</strong> 版本，本模組採用延遲更新機制。</p>\n<h3>如何切換名稱標籤顯示（自 <code>1.2.0</code> 起）</h3>\n<p>部分伺服器可能提供自己的伺服器端實作，\n這可能會與本模組產生渲染衝突。</p>\n<p>為避免此問題，\n您可以在 <code>config/perspectivenametag.server-blacklist.txt</code> 中以逐行形式將伺服器位址加入黑名單。</p>\n<pre><code>mc.example.com\nlocalhost:12345\n127.0.0.1\n...</code></pre>\n<p>對於開發者而言，<code>perspectivenametag-core</code> 提供了公開 API，允許您控制名稱標籤的渲染時機。</p>\n<p>詳細資訊請參閱 <code>icu.suc.kkw557.perspectivenametag.PerspectiveNametag</code>。</p>\n<h2>授權條款</h2>\n<p>本專案採用 <a href=\"LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT 授權條款</a> © 2025 557。</p>",
